  "term": "vitamin deficiency",
  "definition": "In this packet, vitamin deficiency is described as an inherited deficiency involving cobalamin (vitamin B12). It is linked to problems in the vitamin B12 metabolic pathway and can be associated with neurodevelopmental abnormalities.",
